---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { HUBS } from '../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout title="Start Here" description="Choose the right Dama Korea field-guide path for Seoul’s palaces, Gyeongju, Buddhist temples or practical visit planning." activeNav="/start-here/">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="shell visual-shell"><div><p class="eyebrow">Start here</p><h1>Choose one question before choosing ten sites.</h1><p class="page-hero__lede">The clearest heritage days begin with a focus: compare royal spaces, understand a living temple, connect a historic landscape or remove practical uncertainty.</p></div></div>
  </section>
  <section class="section section--paper">
    <div class="shell path-grid">
      <a href={HUBS['seoul-palaces'].href}><span>01</span><div><p>“I want to understand royal Seoul.”</p><h2>Start with Seoul Palaces</h2><small>Comparisons, architecture and focused routes →</small></div></a>
      <a href={HUBS.gyeongju.href}><span>02</span><div><p>“I want to connect a historic city.”</p><h2>Start with Gyeongju</h2><small>Heritage clusters, walking and transport →</small></div></a>
      <a href={HUBS['korean-temples'].href}><span>03</span><div><p>“I am visiting a living religious site.”</p><h2>Start with Korean Temples</h2><small>Etiquette, layouts and visual clues →</small></div></a>
      <a href={HUBS.visit.href}><span>04</span><div><p>“I need the day to work first.”</p><h2>Start with Plan Your Visit</h2><small>Maps, timing, access and fallbacks →</small></div></a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="shell compact-prose"><p class="eyebrow">A useful order</p><h2>Context → official check → route → fallback</h2><p>Read enough context to know what deserves attention. Confirm the current notice with the responsible organization. Build a route that respects time and mobility. Save a fallback so a closure or weather change does not erase the day.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/tools/">Use the planning worksheet</a><a class="button button--secondary" href="/culture/">Browse every collection</a></div></div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
